{"id":"n66104-1-7","stage":1,"title":"쌀쌀하다 · 凉飕飕","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66104-1-7-1","ko":"밖에 나가서 친구 좀 만나고 올게요.","zh":"我出去见个朋友，然后就回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밖에","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"나가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가서","audio":"/audio/585705317584c3255a86.mp3"}},{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"만나고","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나고","audio":"/audio/dea8ba830b515603a2d5.mp3"}},{"text":"올게요.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올게요","audio":"/audio/65fee9486bc51beeb1c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不被某个包围的空间。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/672d396d1fb8be25cd31.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66104-1-7-2","ko":"오늘 날씨가 쌀쌀하니까 옷을 든든하게 입으렴.","zh":"今天天气有点冷，记得穿暖和点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"쌀쌀하니까","meaning":"凉飕飕","explanation":"쌀쌀하다：凉飕飕；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{