e67bea.mp3","entryId":"50551","definition":"厚实、足够保暖（衣物）","pronunciation":["든든하다"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a699888a868372b262a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.608,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66104","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0587,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我要和朋友一起回来，然后就不出去了。","我出去见个朋友，然后就回来。","朋友要来家里，我在这里等他。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天天气炎热，尽量穿少一点。","今天虽然冷，但别穿厚衣服。","今天天气有点冷，记得穿暖和点。"],"answer":2}]}
